1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 17=

2
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:16,940
They've been here.

3
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,140
What?

4
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:19,500
Who?

5
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:20,980
Those bosses?

6
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:22,140
What were they looking for?

7
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,220
Evidence.

8
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:26,100
They came looking for evidence.

9
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:29,300
It seems Xiaozhu and Yijie

10
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:30,660
had more than just
that page of the list.

11
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:38,420
It's me.

12
00:01:39,540 --> 00:01:40,340
Open the door.

13
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:48,340
My adoptive father and his men
are already suspicious.

14
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:49,860
We need to make other plans.

15
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:51,020
What do you mean?

16
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:52,780
Long Feng has gone to my
adoptive father for protection.

17
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:55,540
The Kun Society has already
taken Jiang Menhu away.

18
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:59,500
Boss Ren wants to take over
Lv Mengde's operation.

19
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:03,540
He founded the Kun Society himself.

20
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,420
On the surface, it was meant
to legitimize the gangs,

21
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:09,260
but in reality, it corrupted
legitimate society.

22
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,620
All these years, his greatest fear

23
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:13,060
has been that someone might replace him.

24
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:15,740
Lv Mengde only returned
to Shanghai four years ago.

25
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:16,980
The Kuang family's business

26
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:19,020
has also been restricted
by the New Life Movement.

27
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:21,300
What threat could he possibly pose?

28
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,900
Actually,
right after Dong Zhenglun died,

29
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:26,220
when the Kun Society bosses
joined forces to back Lv Mengde

30
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:27,500
as the successor to
the loan shark business,

31
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,100
he already began to suspect something.

32
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:34,820
In just four years,

33
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:36,940
Lv Mengde managed
to win over so many people.

34
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:39,380
There must be enormous
profits behind it.

35
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:41,020
My adoptive father wants
to uncover the truth

36
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:43,100
and take those profits for himself.

37
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:45,500
Profit comes before everything else.

38
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:47,420
It seems

39
00:02:47,620 --> 00:02:49,700
Boss Ren won't step in
to see justice done.

40
00:02:52,780 --> 00:02:54,220
If they join forces,

41
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:57,820
we'll go from pawns
to disposable pieces.

42
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:01,740
Then is there no other way?

43
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,010
Publish it in the newspapers.

44
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:13,340
Before the Kun Society makes its move,

45
00:03:13,700 --> 00:03:15,220
we'll expose the whole thing

46
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,640
and force the police
to reopen the investigation.

47
00:03:17,420 --> 00:03:18,660
Are you serious?

48
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:20,340
Publishing it will keep them occupied

49
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:21,860
and buy us some time.

50
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:23,780
We might even save those girls.

51
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:25,780
But with only
the con artists' confessions,

52
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:27,460
we can't prove Lv Mengde's involvement.

53
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:30,020
Even if we can't fully implicate him,

54
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:31,220
shouldn't those people's crimes

55
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:32,500
still be exposed?

56
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,660
What I mean is,

57
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:35,580
do you realize how dangerous

58
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,540
it is to go after those people?

59
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:38,500
Mr. Jing.

60
00:03:38,830 --> 00:03:40,220
You're part of the Kun Society yourself.

61
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:41,580
Once that list is made public,

62
00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:42,860
we won't just be exposing a small part.

63
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:44,380
We'll be exposing everything.

64
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,420
I know.

65
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:49,540
But that's exactly what I want.

66
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:51,660
Over the years,

67
00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:53,500
most of the donations
to Cishan Foundation

68
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:56,500
have come from those bosses
and high-ranking officials.

69
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:58,100
They commit crimes

70
00:03:58,220 --> 00:03:59,020
and ruin people's lives,

71
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:00,700
then donate some money to my foundation

72
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:01,980
to buy themselves absolution.

73
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:05,620
But who created all those
disabled people, orphans, and widows

74
00:04:05,820 --> 00:04:07,100
in the first place?

75
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,820
They did.

76
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,260
My adoptive father saved my life.

77
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,300
It's only right that I repay him.

78
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:15,100
But I'm tired

79
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,820
of cleaning up after the Kun Society,

80
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:19,140
sweeping away the filth
hidden beneath its glamour.

81
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,080
We may be taking different paths,
but we share the same goal.

82
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:28,420
I'm asking you to help me.

83
00:04:47,140 --> 00:04:47,940
Yan Qing.

84
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,460
I know you have contacts at
an underground printing house.

85
00:04:50,980 --> 00:04:52,140
Could you persuade them

86
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,340
to let us use it?

87
00:04:53,820 --> 00:04:54,740
You needn't worry.

88
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:56,340
I can guarantee your safety.

89
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:57,980
If you're still concerned,

90
00:04:58,220 --> 00:04:59,820
we can start a new publication

91
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:01,460
without revealing your name.

92
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:03,700
I'll cover the expenses.

93
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:09,300
You don't really think
I'm that foolish, do you?

94
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:11,420
A story this big

95
00:05:11,610 --> 00:05:13,420
comes along once in a decade.

96
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:14,740
If I publish it anonymously,

97
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,540
how will I make a name
for myself in Shanghai?

98
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:17,940
Besides,

99
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:20,460
I have my own reasons.

100
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:22,900
Yan Qing.

101
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:24,740
What I need to know

102
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:26,460
is whether you've all
thought this through.

103
00:05:26,700 --> 00:05:27,860
Once we begin,

104
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,340
there's no turning back.

105
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:33,060
I have an idea.

106
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:36,620
Could we leave out the victims' names

107
00:05:36,620 --> 00:05:37,820
and publish only those
of the perpetrators?

108
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:40,180
Yuhe is right.

109
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,860
Once the victims'
identities are revealed,

110
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:46,020
public attention will shift away
from the real issue.

111
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:51,900
This is how we operate
our brothels in Nanyang.

112
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:53,980
We learn what our clients like

113
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:56,300
and train suitable cats to their tastes.

114
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,760
(Cat Training Register)

115
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,620
(Jiang Ning, Yang Rui, Lu Xiaohua, Jiang Aiyu)
A few pages are missing from the middle.

116
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:01,260
Lv Mengde was careless,

117
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:02,900
(Yingshi, Meigui, Fengping, Yuetang)
and Mei Xiaozhu stole them.

118
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:04,300
My guess is

119
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,420
she gave them
to her fake sister, Kuang Yijie.

120
00:06:06,900 --> 00:06:08,300
But that's all in the past.

121
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:09,340
It doesn't matter anymore.

122
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:11,980
You and Lv Mengde

123
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,780
certainly ran a sophisticated operation.

124
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:18,540
I've laid everything
I have before you now.

125
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:20,780
Boss Ren.

126
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:24,260
You must protect my wealth
and status in Shanghai.

127
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:28,180
You'll continue running this business.

128
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:31,540
I'll take eighty percent
of every transaction.

129
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:33,020
However,

130
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,820
the cats you train

131
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,860
had better be useful
to me in other ways.

132
00:06:39,300 --> 00:06:40,220
For example?

133
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,020
Gathering information

134
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,740
or killing people.

135
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:50,660
We train house cats.

136
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,300
Wildcats like Mei Xiaozhu,
who kill recklessly

137
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:55,380
and refuse to be trained, are rare.

138
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:58,260
That's your problem,

139
00:06:58,420 --> 00:06:59,420
not mine.

140
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:01,220
If you fail to do your job,

141
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,340
you'll end up a corpse

142
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:08,300
floating down the Huangpu River
back to Nanyang.

143
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:09,340
Understood.

144
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:11,780
You can count on me.

145
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:14,980
If my cats can't kill for you,

146
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:17,700
I'll do it myself.

147
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:20,380
Lv Mengde and I

148
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:22,700
had planned a cruise party
for the end of the month.

149
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:25,260
The invitations have already gone out.

150
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,420
All the guests are bosses on the list.

151
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:29,620
Whether we find him or not,

152
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:32,740
we can still hold the party as planned.

153
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:35,500
Give me a list of those
you want eliminated.

154
00:07:36,460 --> 00:07:38,020
I'll get them aboard.

155
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,980
On a dark, windy night,

156
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:41,940
far from shore,

157
00:07:43,020 --> 00:07:44,620
it'll be the perfect time to strike.

158
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:51,580
You're better at business
than Lv Mengde.

159
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:03,820
Yijie is back?

160
00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:04,780
How is he?

161
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:05,780
He's all right now, isn't he?

162
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:07,460
He's dead.

163
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,060
What?

164
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:15,380
Yijie?

165
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:22,180
Didn't they say he was out of danger?

166
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:23,060
How could...

167
00:08:23,820 --> 00:08:24,980
You got him killed.

168
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:26,340
Me?

169
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:28,500
Yijie and Xiaozhu,

170
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:30,420
my two children,

171
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:33,260
both died because of you.

172
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:35,140
What are you talking about?

173
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:40,740
You brought that illegitimate son
into our home.

174
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:42,380
You covered up his lies

175
00:08:42,380 --> 00:08:43,420
and hid his disgrace,

176
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:45,380
putting your own grandchildren

177
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,940
in a helpless situation

178
00:08:47,330 --> 00:08:48,700
and exposing them to danger.

179
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:49,500
Nonsense!

180
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,620
Have you lost your mind?

181
00:08:50,620 --> 00:08:51,420
I'm not crazy.

182
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,020
At the funeral,

183
00:08:54,020 --> 00:08:55,860
Lv Mengde shot and wounded Yijie.

184
00:08:56,580 --> 00:08:58,100
He barely survived,

185
00:08:58,500 --> 00:08:59,380
only to be poisoned to death

186
00:08:59,380 --> 00:09:01,140
by the woman Lv Mengde
brought back from Nanyang.

187
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:02,820
What?

188
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:04,700
Yijie was shot

189
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:06,700
by Mengde at the funeral?

190
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:07,660
But why would Mengde

191
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:09,380
shoot him for no reason?

192
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:11,180
You'll have to ask your precious son!

193
00:09:12,460 --> 00:09:14,260
What exactly did he do to those girls?

194
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:16,700
And what did those bosses

195
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:18,220
on the register do?

196
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:19,900
The register?

197
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:37,180
Yinyue.

198
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:41,860
You really shouldn't have
found out about any of this.

199
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:53,580
Young Lady, have some porridge.

200
00:09:55,300 --> 00:09:56,100
Where's Yijie?

201
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:58,100
What has Father done with Yijie?

202
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:00,020
Don't worry, Young Lady.

203
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,600
Yijie was Master's
own grandson, after all.

204
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,340
Master invited a ritual master

205
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,380
early this morning to perform
funeral rites at the ancestral hall.

206
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:07,620
He'll take care of
the funeral arrangements.

207
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:09,940
I want to see Ding Yiyi.

208
00:10:10,820 --> 00:10:11,860
Master has given orders.

209
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:13,300
You're not allowed to see anyone.

210
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:14,460
Li.

211
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,060
I take Master's money

212
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,300
and carry out his orders.

213
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:18,580
I can give you money too.

214
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:19,780
How much do you want?

215
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,020
Young Lady.

216
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:25,260
Please don't make
things difficult for me.

217
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,900
Bring Ding Yiyi downstairs.

218
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,220
Let me see her

219
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,100
just once.

220
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:31,380
Please?

221
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:33,020
I'm begging you.

222
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:35,900
What did you say?

223
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:40,100
Brother Li, I'm begging you.

224
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:48,060
For the sake of all the years
we grew up together,

225
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:49,060
please help me.

226
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:50,980
I have something
very important to ask her.

227
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,460
It's been twenty years

228
00:10:53,020 --> 00:10:54,500
since you last called me that.

229
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:56,940
The esteemed
eldest young lady is begging me.

230
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:58,460
Help you?

231
00:10:58,700 --> 00:11:00,020
What do I get in return?

232
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:01,020
Do you want money?

233
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:02,620
When the old man dies,

234
00:11:02,620 --> 00:11:03,740
I'll give you all his money.

235
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:06,100
The entire Kuang family fortune
will be yours.

236
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,860
That's a promise for the future.

237
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,900
It's not yours to make.

238
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,140
I'd rather have something right now.

239
00:11:12,620 --> 00:11:14,620
Li! What are you doing?

240
00:11:14,660 --> 00:11:15,500
Young Lady.

241
00:11:16,020 --> 00:11:17,460
You're the one who begged me.

242
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:20,540
Dong Zhenglun should've died long ago.

243
00:11:21,100 --> 00:11:22,420
If they wanted a man
to marry into the family,

244
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:24,380
why couldn't it have been me?

245
00:11:24,860 --> 00:11:26,500
We grew up together, after all.

246
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:27,620
Li!

247
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:28,420
You monster!

248
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:29,340
You're a monster!

249
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:38,380
Some names
on Dr. Bai's patient list overlap.

250
00:11:39,180 --> 00:11:41,220
These are the ones she marked
with black cat symbols.

251
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:42,620
Add them all.

252
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,220
All right.

253
00:11:58,260 --> 00:12:00,460
These are women whose accidental deaths

254
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:01,820
were reported in recent news.

255
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:03,100
See if any of the names overlap.

256
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:03,780
All right.

257
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:10,480
(Dance Star Dies Tragically on
Her Way Home)

258
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,080
(Young Beauty Lost to the River,
Her Fate Unresolved in the Huangpu's Waves)

259
00:12:25,780 --> 00:12:26,980
You only have ten minutes.

260
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:27,860
Make it quick.

261
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:31,940
Mrs. Kuang.

262
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,260
Miss Mei once showed me

263
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:36,780
a piece of paper
Yijie and Xiaozhu found.

264
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:38,660
It had black cat designs on it,

265
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,740
along with women's names

266
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,020
and men's names.

267
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:43,780
That's the business
Lv Mengde was running,

268
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:44,500
isn't it?

269
00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:46,300
I don't know.

270
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:49,060
I don't know anything.

271
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:50,950
Did he trick you with promises of love

272
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:53,740
and offer you to other men as a favor?

273
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:54,700
I don't know.

274
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:55,700
I don't know anything.

275
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:56,940
Please stop asking me!

276
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,020
Even if you escape this room,

277
00:12:58,020 --> 00:12:59,460
can you escape their clutches?

278
00:13:01,820 --> 00:13:03,620
Lv Mengde has vanished without a trace.

279
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:05,780
He's either dead or has fled.

280
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:07,420
He won't be coming back for you.

281
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:10,340
Ding Yiyi.

282
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,980
Do you want to spend
your whole life living in the shadow

283
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:16,300
of deception, abandonment,
and humiliation,

284
00:13:16,780 --> 00:13:18,340
or will you calm down and think

285
00:13:18,420 --> 00:13:19,940
about what you want for your future?

286
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:24,140
The child you're carrying

287
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,060
is Lv Mengde's, isn't it?

288
00:13:25,060 --> 00:13:26,140
You know the truth.

289
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:28,660
Or do you actually want to marry him?

290
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:29,500
No.

291
00:13:29,900 --> 00:13:31,380
I'd rather die.

292
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:33,580
Then pull yourself together

293
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:35,540
and find a way for you
and your family to survive.

294
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,380
Come here.

295
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:41,020
I'll tell you what to do.

296
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:29,940
Hello?

297
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:30,620
Hello?

298
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:31,820
Tell Miss Mei to go to San...

299
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:40,620
Hello?

300
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:42,620
The article is ready.

301
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,140
It'll be in tomorrow's morning paper.

302
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:46,060
Ding Yiyi called.

303
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:47,220
Yiyi?

304
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:48,660
What did she say?

305
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,020
She only got half a sentence
out before hanging up.

306
00:14:50,020 --> 00:14:50,900
Half a sentence?

307
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:52,860
She said we should go to San...

308
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:53,740
The Sanxun Gathering?

309
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,820
It's the City God procession for
the Ghost Festival that the Kun Society

310
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:57,660
and City God Temple Board
are organizing at the end of the month.

311
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,860
But why would Yiyi

312
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,860
suddenly mention the Sanxun Gathering?

313
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:08,140
Could it be

314
00:15:08,660 --> 00:15:10,860
that Mrs. Kuang asked her
to make that call?

315
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:17,580
You mean Yijie disguised
himself as a girl

316
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:20,460
to spend time with Xiaozhu?

317
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,340
I don't understand

318
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:28,100
why he did that either.

319
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:30,780
But what happened to him and Xiaozhu

320
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,260
must be connected to this list

321
00:15:32,300 --> 00:15:33,940
and the black cats on it.

322
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:40,240
(Lisa, Kong Shun,
Mei Xiaozhu, Dong Zhenglun)

323
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:43,820
No wonder he was
so distracted all summer.

324
00:15:44,220 --> 00:15:45,620
He went out whenever he had the chance,

325
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:50,900
claiming he was helping prepare
for the Sanxun Gathering.

326
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:53,860
It's my fault.

327
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:58,500
I should have realized sooner.

328
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:00,060
If I'd noticed earlier,

329
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,820
I could have helped them sooner.

330
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:02,900
Maybe...

331
00:16:03,620 --> 00:16:05,660
Maybe none of what followed
would have happened.

332
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:09,980
I used to think the same way.

333
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:11,540
If only I'd noticed sooner

334
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:13,140
and stopped it in time.

335
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:16,700
But what's done is done.

336
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,180
We have no choice

337
00:16:25,380 --> 00:16:26,540
but to keep investigating.

338
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:40,100
Miss Mei.

339
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:42,260
Tell me.

340
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,220
What can I do

341
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:45,340
to help you?

342
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:46,780
If it's convenient,

343
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:49,500
could you search Yijie's room

344
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:52,340
and see if there are any other lists?

345
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:58,060
Remember?

346
00:16:58,660 --> 00:17:01,540
Xiaozhu and Yijie changed clothes
at the hot water shop.

347
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:04,300
But to keep his secret,

348
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:06,780
Yijie wouldn't have brought
the qipao and wig home.

349
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:08,260
He must have hidden them somewhere else.

350
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:10,140
If Mrs. Kuang

351
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:12,860
can't find the remaining pages at home,

352
00:17:13,820 --> 00:17:14,660
that means...

353
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:16,820
Young Master.

354
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:18,060
What brings you here so late?

355
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:19,260
I'm here to get something.

356
00:17:19,260 --> 00:17:20,420
Carry on with your meal.

357
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:20,920
All right.

358
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:22,420
Come on, everyone.

359
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:23,460
Let's keep eating.

360
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:33,900
It's not the Sanxun Gathering.

361
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:36,660
It's the Sanshi Club.

362
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:37,900
The Sanshi Club?

363
00:17:39,770 --> 00:17:42,520
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

364
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:46,160
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

365
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:49,560
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

366
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,520
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

367
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,080
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

368
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,040
♪But I refuse to fall♪

369
00:17:55,040 --> 00:18:00,080
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

370
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:02,560
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

371
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:06,560
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

372
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:09,840
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

373
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:12,760
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

374
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:16,200
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

375
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,600
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

376
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,520
♪Those who have hurt me♪

377
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:26,840
♪I choose to pierce through♪

378
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:30,000
♪To tear apart♪

379
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:36,080
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

380
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,640
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

381
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:42,640
♪Nor bow to power♪

382
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,080
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

383
00:18:46,840 --> 00:18:50,520
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
